{
  "name": "n8n Template Catalog Vector Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛠️ 01 - n8n Template Catalog Vector Sync\n**Purpose:** Daily incremental ingestion of community workflow templates into Qdrant for local RAG retrieval.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n* Host Ollama running `nomic-embed-text:latest`\n* Qdrant instance listening on port 6333 (`n8n_templates` collection)\n* Schedule: Runs daily at 02:00 AM local time",
        "height": 268,
        "width": 1516,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -416
      ],
      "id": "5f257bcf-9b8f-4db5-b48c-62693eec4816",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Intro"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Ingestion & Incremental Fetch\nFetches top community templates from n8n public catalog API.\n* Pages 1–2 only (~200 items) for daily updates.\n* Splits collection array into individual workflow items.",
        "height": 332,
        "width": 592,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -128
      ],
      "id": "0ca81787-4803-4681-b6a7-78b113b05f84",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Ingestion"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Full Extraction & Security Audit\n* Pulls full workflow metadata, sticky note text, and system prompts.\n* Strips non-printable ASCII/hex control characters.\n* Scans node configuration strings for exposed API keys.",
        "height": 332,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1248,
        -128
      ],
      "id": "e14e532d-0818-46a1-81b2-5c2027ffc832",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Audit"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Embed & Vector Indexing\n* Embeds text content via Ollama (`nomic-embed-text`).\n* Upserts vectors and metadata into Qdrant `n8n_templates` collection.",
        "height": 508,
        "width": 468,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1696,
        -128
      ],
      "id": "f6472ac9-ff1f-45dd-863f-c326c5669809",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Qdrant"
    },
